{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"gen-1788418703-RXIm0mLyVZIFvKBbjKyN","type":"message","role":"assistant","container":null,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n\nI've successfully implemented support for parameterized generic types in the `ConfigSet.add_config` method. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## Changes Made\n\n### 1. Fix in `src/tox/config/loader/convert.py`\n\nModified the `to()` method to detect and handle parameterized generic types (like `list[str]`, `set[int]`, `dict[str, int]`) by checking for the `__origin__` attribute:\n\n```python\n# Check for typing module types or parameterized generics (e.g., list[str], set[int])\nfrom_module = getattr(of_type, \"__module__\", None)\nhas_origin = hasattr(of_type, \"__origin__\")\nif from_module in {\"typing\", \"typing_extensions\"} or has_origin:\n    return self._to_typing(raw, of_type, factory)\n```\n\nThis allows Python 3.9+ built-in generic type syntax to work alongside the existing `typing` module types.\n\n### 2. New Tests in `tests/config/test_sets.py`\n\nAdded four new tests to validate the functionality:\n- `test_config_list_parameterized` - Tests `list[str]` type\n- `test_config_set_parameterized` - Tests `set[int]` type\n- `test_config_dict_parameterized` - Tests `dict[str, int]` type\n- `test_config_optional_parameterized` - Tests `Optional[int]` type\n\n### 3. Changelog Entry in `docs/changelog/parameterized-generics.feature.rst`\n\nDocumented the feature:\n> Support parameterized generic types (e.g., ``list[str]``, ``set[int]``, ``dict[str, int]``) in ``ConfigSet.add_config`` ``of_type`` parameter, allowing use of Python 3.9+ built-in generic type syntax instead of ``typing`` module imports.\n\n## Verification\n\nAll 1059 existing config tests pass, and all 4 new tests for parameterized generics also pass. The change is backward compatible and works seamlessly with existing type handling for simple types.","citations":[]}],"model":"inception/mercury-2.5-preview","stop_reason":null,"stop_details":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_details":null,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"inference_geo":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null,"speed":"standard"},"provider":"Inception","context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cb0f6f6f-51e6-41a4-8fa5-1626e82bdc6e","uuid":"1afb110e-577a-4742-9000-1144e77d962b","timestamp":"2026-09-03T06:58:25.351Z","request_id":"gen-1788418703-RXIm0mLyVZIFvKBbjKyN"}
